<title>USA: BAB names Tom Fletcher COO.</title>
<headline>BAB names Tom Fletcher COO.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>BAB Holdings Inc said Thursday it had named Tom Fletcher chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Fletcher was previously director of retail brands for Allied Domecq Plc.</p>
</text>
